WEBVTT

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.620
Looks like the village rumors are true.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.130
Yeah.

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.460
Best to turn in quickly.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.670
After a battle,

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:26.760
the souls of those who died
with regrets tend to wander there.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.020
It is likely that on Mount Azuchi,

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.470
there are also men of courage,

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.690
who do not even
comprehend that they have died,

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:37.020
continuing to struggle
with pain and suffering.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.110
I imagine so.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.160
According to the villagers,

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:44.450
Lady O-Ichi, the younger sister of
the Devil King of the Sixth Heaven,

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:49.960
is apparently rumored to haunt the
remains of Azuchi Castle as a ghost.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.380
They say she despairs of
Oda's vicissitudes of fortune

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.920
and can be heard sobbing nightly.

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.850
So, that really is...

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:10.300
...Lady O-Ichi.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.890
How anguished she sounds...

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:40.500
And here I was
wondering who it might be...

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:42.460
So it is you.

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:45.670
I could not be more
honored to meet you again.

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:50.510
You are... Matsunaga Hisahide!

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:53.470
Why... What are you doing here?!

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:55.470
Did you hear it, too?

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:59.930
This pitiable sobbing... this weeping...

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:09.780
Lady... O-Ichi...

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:13.610
Younger sister of Oda Nobunaga,
Devil King of the Sixth Heaven.

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:15.540
O-Ichi.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:19.340
She is now caught between
this world and the netherworld,

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:25.840
unable to determine whether
she is there as a living being or not...

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.800
The Oda almost had the country in their grasp,

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:31.130
but now she is the last survivor.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:33.390
And a shadow of her former self at that.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:36.180
Then, are you also...?!

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:38.810
Do I look like it?

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.510
Matsunaga Hisahide...

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:44.820
At that great temple, I was certain that you...

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:52.990
A trump card is something
you save until the very end.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:56.790
Did you think that I had
welcomed you on that occasion

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:02.420
without even preparing
a secret passage or two?

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.420
Fearful of the voice of the Devil King's sister,

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.750
echoing like a curse from
the bowels of the Earth,

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:10.090
no one came near this place.

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:13.760
Thanks to that, I was able to
observe the world at my leisure, but...

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:17.680
Wh-What is that in your hand?!

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:23.980
Oda Nobunaga used the heads of the
generals he defeated as sake goblets.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:27.780
The Devil King met his end here in Azuchi Castle

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.820
and having a drink from
his skull would not be amiss.

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.400
Do you not think so?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.780
For those who died,
burned alive and trampled

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:40.120
in the great call for a
world under warrior rule,

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:43.950
it will surely serve to honor
them to some extent as well.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:47.630
This is an... inhuman deed!

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:51.170
He may have been the
Devil King of the Sixth Heaven,

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:53.720
but he was a warrior who
made his name in this turbulent era.

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:56.670
And now that he has
departed for the land of the dead,

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:59.230
to ransack this castle,
which is essentially his casket,

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.770
not to mention contemplating
making off with his remains...

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.770
This is nothing short of disrespecting the dead!

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:08.190
As I recall, it was none other than
you and the One-Eyed Dragon of Oshu

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:12.820
who laid the Devil King to
rest upon this land, was it not?

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:16.820
Is it the nature of things

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:19.660
to grow attached to
those whom you have killed?

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:24.920
Or have you conveniently
forgotten that you are a murderer

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:28.340
and would now deem me evil
for making off with this object,

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:30.840
which is now merely a thing?

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:35.140
Goodness, what truly curious logic.

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:43.650
Astonishingly, I do not
dislike this logic of yours.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:47.650
Incidentally, about Date
Masamune, the One-Eyed Dragon,

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:50.520
who worked with you to
rouse the eastern forces

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:52.200
and drove Oda to his ruin...

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:54.900
I heard this from one of my messengers,

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:57.580
but it seems he tragically lost his life

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:00.370
facing Toyotomi's clandestine invasion.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.200
Lord Masamune?!

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.530
It seems he was boxed
in by the lands of Oshu,

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.330
which were once under his rule.

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:09.290
Much like Oda was.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.630
"As a man sows, so shall he reap " was well said.

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:16.930
I hear he had suffered
injuries from head to toe,

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:21.810
when Toyotomi Hideyoshi came
himself to deliver the final blow.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:22.980
So unfortunate...

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:26.100
That I was unable to take his
Six Dragon Swords in the end.

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.350
They have likely all been smashed to pieces,

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:34.060
exposed to the bloody winds
like grave markers upon Suriagehara.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:36.320
Oshu is in that direction.

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:39.990
The least you can do is pray that
your comrade-in-arms rests in peace.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:46.330
And take care that Kai and Takeda
do not suffer the same fate as Date.

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:47.880
And now, you will have to excuse me.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.920
Halt!

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:51.260
No matter what predicament

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:54.960
Date Masamune, the
One-Eyed Dragon, found himself in,

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:57.640
he is not a general who
would be defeated so easily!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:02.720
And Kai and the Takeda will never
waver as long as my lord is alive!

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:05.140
Leave that skull behind!

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:07.940
No matter what kind of
demonic fiend Oda Nobunaga was,

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.520
committing all manners of
cruel and outrageous deeds,

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:15.650
it is only right that his dignity
as a warrior should be defended!

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:18.980
As one of the last to engage the
Devil King of the Sixth Heaven in combat,

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:22.570
I absolutely cannot permit
you to take that with you!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.910
It is an illusion...

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:32.460
And that illusion holds
men in thrall to foolish ideas.

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:34.410
The Devil King was the Devil King.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:37.130
You saw for yourself the
black misfortune that he was

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:40.630
and the deeds that he committed.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:45.010
And yet, you would remember
only that Nobunaga was a warrior,

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:47.970
and you would fabricate
your perception of him

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:52.770
to glorify his memory
with the passage of time?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.950
The turbulent times, this country,
making your way to Kyoto...

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:08.330
You are merely yet another
agent of carnage called a " general, "

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:12.330
who claims those things as his justification.

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:15.000
Please do not get the wrong idea.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:19.080
It is not that I am questioning
the right or wrong of it now.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:24.340
I am merely saying there is no
need to be as keenly afire as you are.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:28.300
Warring, pillaging, even
our attachment for this world...

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:31.010
They are all human nature.

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:33.970
Ultimately, people are merely
things who consume things,

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:37.030
think things, and say things.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:40.480
No matter what we accomplish
while we are animate things,

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:45.070
someday, we will return to being
things like this, which do nothing.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.830
There is not a single exception to this rule

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:52.380
and naturally, neither you
nor I differ in this matter.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.450
Nor does the One-Eyed Dragon.

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:56.380
If you just think of him as having returned

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:58.710
to being an inanimate
thing one step ahead of you,

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:03.840
surely, even the sorrow of parting
will not wring your heart overly much.

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:06.340
People are...

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:09.470
People are not things!

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:13.300
Passionate souls do not die!

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:16.110
The blood that stirs
within is immortal as well!

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.530
No matter what it is,

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:27.910
as long as you cherish it, even
things will come to harbor souls!

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:34.240
Watching you makes me
hopelessly nostalgic in spite of myself.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:37.800
Though, I was never quite that innocent.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.460
You wield your spears in
the name of a disagreement.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:43.840
In a way, your fate is even
more unfortunate than Nobunaga's.

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:47.920
Perhaps that is why you
were drawn to this place.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:08.370
Become a seal upon this castle keep,
along with the sobbing Devil's sister.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.170
Give it back...

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:31.140
Give it back...

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:33.760
That belongs to my brother...

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.850
Lady O-Ichi...

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:38.640
Give it back...

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.730
Give it back!

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.410
Ichi was...

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:57.380
Ichi was unable to do anything, so...

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:17.020
Ichi will stay by your side forever.

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:18.890
Lady O-Ichi...

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:27.490
It is as if the Lady O-Ichi is
possessed and bound by something.

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:34.660
It's going to be okay, so let's go to sleep.

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:43.460
That is not it!

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:46.170
There is something or someone...

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:48.630
...that she is trying to contain!

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:53.220
What shall I do?!

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.680
I cannot strike down the Lady O-Ichi...

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.860
I have no choice!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.340
Forgive me, Lady O-Ichi!

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:31.420
Blazing Wheel!

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.480
Th-This is...!

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:09.710
Number One?

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.590
Number One!

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:42.580
Was I dreaming or something?

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:43.450
No...

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:46.290
You were already worn ragged

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:48.540
and then you went at it
with Toyotomi Hideyoshi...

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:50.870
So I lost?

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:52.800
Why am I alive?

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:54.300
The thing is...

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:57.300
The odds were stacked
pretty badly against us, but...

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:32.840
Number One!

00:15:57.410 --> 00:16:01.070
He eased up on attacking
us for some reason.

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:04.500
We took that chance to
make a mad scramble and...

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:10.960
We just knew we had to
protect you, even if it killed us...

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:14.040
Or else we'd be worthless...

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:17.750
And we'd never be able to
face Master Katakura, either.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:21.310
Did someone get killed bringing up the rear?

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:25.260
No. All the survivors managed to somehow...

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:27.310
I see.

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.400
Thanks.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:33.730
Number One!

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:35.440
You shouldn't get up yet!

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:40.700
Bunshichi, Mago, is there anything to eat?

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:42.570
Yes, Sir!

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:47.620
Insufficient blood.

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:51.750
That masked lackey and
that wild monkey general...

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:55.050
Talk about both of them
slacking off in the endgame...

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:11.020
I'm begging you! Show him mercy!

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:14.100
Please, don't kill him!

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:17.860
I'll do anything! So...

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:20.440
Please forgive him! He's...

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.820
...my friend!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:33.170
Guess we screwed up...

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:36.550
To think that I, of all people,

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:39.720
would fail to finish off one little snake...

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:40.400
Yeah, we're going to Osaka.

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:43.150
I'll go see him and make him stop this.

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:45.360
Nothing else I can do, right?

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:58.380
Lady... O-Ichi...

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:06.510
The thing that you were trying to
quell with every fiber of your being...

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:12.470
Ah! Lady O-Ichi!

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:14.680
She is really here!

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:17.140
To think that she was still alive!

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:28.740
Are you survivors of the Oda?

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:30.450
That red attire...

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.950
Could it be...

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:34.280
Are you Sanada Yukimura?!

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:37.040
We will avenge Lord Nobunaga!

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:56.810
We intend to take Lady O-Ichi
and attempt to rebuild the Oda,

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:00.810
so we may see each other
again on the battlefield someday.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:06.060
It seems those who had fled and scattered

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:08.020
got wind of the rumor and banded together.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:11.990
Reviving the Oda is surely a vain hope,

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:15.200
but we have no reason to stop them, either.

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:17.870
Master Oyamada,

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:22.130
I apologize for leaving the camp
without a word on this occasion.

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:24.300
Please do not let it weigh upon your mind.

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:25.720
For our lord commanded

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:30.470
that we are always to act
according to your wishes.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:43.150
This was inevitable.

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:59.330
With this, the western portion of
the land of the rising sun will be secure.

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:02.710
I hear there is a force in
Satsuma, about which little is known.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:06.260
That they have continued to rebuff
Toyotomi's every attempt to invade.

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.550
It is all only a matter of time.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:12.630
Now that you have decided to
abandon your strictly defensive policy

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:15.720
and join forces with us.

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:18.720
Why are you so impatient?

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:23.810
You sprung a sneak attack
on Kawanakajima only recently,

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:26.900
and yet, after Date retreated,
you pursued him to Oshu,

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:30.480
and I hear you captured
their strategist, Katakura Kojuro.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.530
For having worked clandestinely for so long...

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:35.740
It means that the stars are beginning to align.

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:37.660
The Mori Army acted wisely.

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:39.740
Second only to us, the Toyotomi,

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:41.790
who watched and waited until the Oda fell,

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:45.870
while quietly putting our energy
towards training elite troops.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:50.290
You have been waiting for
precisely this moment, right?

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:54.760
First,

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.010
we will capture the Fugaku,
Chosokabe's fortress,

00:21:58.100 --> 00:22:00.560
which has given you a lot of trouble.

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:06.810
We will eradicate the pirates
that plague the Inland Sea of Seto.

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:45.460
O Dragon, bereft of your
invaluable right-hand man,

00:23:45.540 --> 00:23:47.960
brave, loyal, righteous, and devoted.

00:23:48.510 --> 00:23:50.460
Now is the time for painstaking efforts.

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:51.930
Do so and the dragon shall soar upon the clouds.

00:23:52.840 --> 00:23:55.960
Next time, once again, fiercely
passionate and solemnly unrelenting.
